# web-react UI

- Design system: **shadcn/ui (Radix)** under `apps/web-react/src/components/ui` + oklch zinc tokens in `src/styles.css` (parity with Angular `apps/web`).
- Do **not** import `@spartan-ng/helm/*`, call `@spartan-ng/mcp`, or reuse Angular `libs/ui`.
- Add UI via `npx shadcn@latest add <name>` from `apps/web-react`; keep token values aligned with `apps/web/src/styles.css`.
- See `apps/web-react/AGENTS.md`.
